### DueTrack API requests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request").
### For Thunder Client / Postman, copy the method, URL and JSON body of each request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health check  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Create (valid)  -> 201   (copy the "_id" from the response into @id below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "React Router Activity",
  "course": "DCIT 26",
  "dueDate": "2030-01-15T10:00:00.000Z",
  "priority": "High",
  "category": "Lab",
  "description": "Add routes and a dynamic detail page."
}

### 3. Create (invalid - missing title)  -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course": "DCIT 26",
  "dueDate": "2030-01-15T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### 4. Get all  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/assignments

### 5. Get all, filtered and sorted  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/assignments?status=Pending&search=react&sort=-dueDate

### 6. Get all, search with no match  -> 200 with []
GET {{baseUrl}}/assignments?search=zzzzNoMatchzzzz

### Paste a real id here:
@id = PASTE_ID_HERE

### 7. Get by id  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/assignments/{{id}}

### 8. Get by id (does not exist)  -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/assignments/000000000000000000000000

### 9. Get by id (malformed id)  -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/assignments/abc123

### 10. Update (PUT)  -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/assignments/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "React Router Activity (edited)",
  "course": "DCIT 26",
  "dueDate": "2030-02-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "category": "Lab",
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### 11. Update (PUT, invalid - empty title)  -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/assignments/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### 12. Partial update (PATCH)  -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/assignments/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Submitted" }

### 13. Delete  -> 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assignments/{{id}}

### 14. Delete again (already gone)  -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assignments/{{id}}
